                      (      fvmodul.asm):00425         * Entry: D=negative offset from end of module Dir DAT Img)
03E8.                 (      fvmodul.asm):00426         FVmodulEndModDir    ldx       <D.ModDAT ; get end ptr of Module Dir DAT image
